<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GOLF-SOUTH AFRICAN MASTERS FIRST ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SOUTH AFRICAN MASTERS FIRST ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>PORT EDWARD 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading first round scores in</p>
<p>the 750,000 rand ($160,000 dollar) South African Masters golf</p>
<p>tournament at San Lameer Country Club on Thursday (South African</p>
<p>unless stated):</p>
<p>67 Adilson da Silva (Brazil)</p>
<p>71 Mark McNulty (Zimbabwe), Brenden Pappas, Mike Board (U.S.),</p>
<p>Ben Fouchee, Van Phillips (Britain)</p>
<p>72 Neil Homann, Brad Ott (U.S.), Marco Gortana, Gavin</p>
<p>Levenson, Jeff Hawkes, Steven Waltman, Mark Wiltshire, Wayne</p>
<p>Westner, Sean Pappas, Philip Jonas</p>
<p>73 Greg Peterson (U.S.), Deane Pappas, Des Terblanche,</p>
<p>Retief Goosen, James Kingston, Ian Hutchings, Wayne Bradley</p>
<p>74 John McHenry (Ireland), Hugh Baiocchi.</p>
</text>
